# ahr-deck

A PowerPoint-style deck, in your terminal.

Use the **arrow keys** to move between slides, `q` to quit.

---

## How it works

- One file, slides separated by `---`
- Each slide is plain **Markdown**
- Content is centered, with a man-style footer below

---

```deck:slide
title: Diagrams
```

## Mermaid, inline

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Write .ahr-deck] --> B[ahr deck.ahr-deck]
    B --> C{Present}
    C --> D[Arrow keys]
    C --> E[q to quit]
```

---

```deck:slide
title: Overrides
```

## Per-slide titles

This slide overrides the footer title via its own `deck:slide` block.

Everything else falls back to the deck title.

---

